        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937520/extras/202d68f8255d89d02d83556c18a6b81f.avif?t=1772070157\" width=550 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937520/extras/aa32cd38d90827164b8e201773bac6f5.avif?t=1772070157\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sacred Earth - Reverie</strong> is a fantasy JRPG presented in the style of Point and Click games, inspired by  JRPGs from the 2000s and 2010s. Explore dungeons, interact with your allies and the townsfolk, build your characters with equipment, abilities, and perks, and test your might against foes in thrilling turn-based combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Make peace with the past and embrace the future</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the ashes of a fallen golden age, long following the heroic deeds of the legendary group of heroes known as Illuminate, humanity now fights a seemingly endless war. At its heart stands the Demon Queen. An inscrutable force said to be the enemy of mankind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After yet another catastrophic campaign ends in broken banners and lost morale, a battle-scarred knight of the Kingdom of Amarcia can no longer stomach the lies swirling about within this conflict. With a single doubt in their mind, they ask themselves: Are they truly fighting for salvation? Is the Demon Queen the monster their noble masters claim her to be?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Casting aside their armor, a lone knight takes up their sword and sets forth into the wilds. Seeking the truth behind the Demon Queen. The truth behind the heroic legacy of Illuminate, and perhaps the truth behind the current era.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937520/extras/910a654cd9c8e45fe9808bbe7b0875bf.avif?t=1772070157\" width=550 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937520/extras/5d4b048ecb41931bd0860b13e5f5d0e6.avif?t=1772070157\" width=457 height=356 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose between Cain or Abelle to be the protagonist of your journey. They have differing personalities as well as differing dialogue at points. But their stories are the same, so choose who you prefer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937520/extras/3203180fddbab5abe8b9a1de1a31b6dc.avif?t=1772070157\" width=550 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937520/extras/4104829abd354e567ace0ebca463f63f.poster.avif?t=1772070157\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937520/extras/4104829abd354e567ace0ebca463f63f.webm?t=1772070157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937520/extras/4104829abd354e567ace0ebca463f63f.mp4?t=1772070157\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize point and click functions to explore dungeons and study the environment. Seek treasures and interact with your allies to learn more about each other and your surroundings as you advance the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937520/extras/33897e8b00f263dc8ae29bc573a30cf1.avif?t=1772070157\" width=550 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937520/extras/87795485cc333cae1a2e2fc6489a66fa.poster.avif?t=1772070157\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937520/extras/87795485cc333cae1a2e2fc6489a66fa.webm?t=1772070157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937520/extras/87795485cc333cae1a2e2fc6489a66fa.mp4?t=1772070157\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A colorful cast of townspeople await in the Town of Istina. Learn about their daily lives, as well as those of your allies, as you pass the times together. Gear up for your next dungeon, take quests, and wind down with amusing conversations and side events. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937520/extras/239d6cae3dda349c40f452fb1e01745f.avif?t=1772070157\" width=550 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937520/extras/52bc35d5a3f45269cde90ff355df5ee6.poster.avif?t=1772070157\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937520/extras/52bc35d5a3f45269cde90ff355df5ee6.webm?t=1772070157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937520/extras/52bc35d5a3f45269cde90ff355df5ee6.mp4?t=1772070157\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in speedy turn-based battles against dangerous enemies utilizing various resources. Each character has a unique skill set with special interactions and conditional effects. Learn what each of your allies can do, Chain together Arts for big damage, upgrade your Arts with additional perks, and manage your resources in order to come out on top.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937520/extras/3040f4e1352abf3ca63d184d5a6af5d5.avif?t=1772070157\" width=550 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937520/extras/04485b06a9c343b518adf0d8b5093868.avif?t=1772070157\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your actions will decide the fates of these characters. Experience multiple endings depending on how you approach exploration and the story. Keep your eyes peeled for hidden events and interactions. They just may change the course of the narrative in unexpected ways.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937520/extras/202d68f8255d89d02d83556c18a6b81f.avif?t=1772070157\" width=550 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937520/extras/aa32cd38d90827164b8e201773bac6f5.avif?t=1772070157\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sacred Earth - Reverie</strong> is a fantasy JRPG presented in the style of Point and Click games, inspired by  JRPGs from the 2000s and 2010s. Explore dungeons, interact with your allies and the townsfolk, build your characters with equipment, abilities, and perks, and test your might against foes in thrilling turn-based combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Make peace with the past and embrace the future</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the ashes of a fallen golden age, long following the heroic deeds of the legendary group of heroes known as Illuminate, humanity now fights a seemingly endless war. At its heart stands the Demon Queen. An inscrutable force said to be the enemy of mankind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After yet another catastrophic campaign ends in broken banners and lost morale, a battle-scarred knight of the Kingdom of Amarcia can no longer stomach the lies swirling about within this conflict. With a single doubt in their mind, they ask themselves: Are they truly fighting for salvation? Is the Demon Queen the monster their noble masters claim her to be?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Casting aside their armor, a lone knight takes up their swor