_assets/steam/apps/2937520/extras/52bc35d5a3f45269cde90ff355df5ee6.poster.avif?t=1772070157\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937520/extras/52bc35d5a3f45269cde90ff355df5ee6.webm?t=1772070157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937520/extras/52bc35d5a3f45269cde90ff355df5ee6.mp4?t=1772070157\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in speedy turn-based battles against dangerous enemies utilizing various resources. Each character has a unique skill set with special interactions and conditional effects. Learn what each of your allies can do, Chain together Arts for big damage, upgrade your Arts with additional perks, and manage your resources in order to come out on top.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937520/extras/3040f4e1352abf3ca63d184d5a6af5d5.avif?t=1772070157\" width=550 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937520/extras/04485b06a9c343b518adf0d8b5093868.avif?t=1772070157\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your actions will decide the fates of these characters. Experience multiple endings depending on how you approach exploration and the story. Keep your eyes peeled for hidden events and interactions. They just may change the course of the narrative in unexpected ways.</p>",
